---
source: crates/philo-tui/src/app/state.rs
description: slash help output remains stable across source layout changes
assertion_line: 715
expression: "texts(&appended(&run(&mut app, \"/help\"))).join(\"\\n\")"
---
/help
commands:
  /help               commands and key bindings
  /new                start a new session
  /sessions           pick a session to continue
  /model <name>       switch the model (idle only)
  /reasoning <level>  reasoning effort, from the next turn on
  /image <path>       attach an image to the next message
  /verbose            toggle the information tier (same as Ctrl+O)
  /status             session, model, usage and the tool lineup
  /config             effective configuration and its source layers
  /quit               leave the session
keys:
  Enter submit (queued while busy) | Ctrl+J newline (Shift+Enter where supported)
  Esc cancel the running turn | Ctrl+C clear input, cancel, or press twice to exit
  Ctrl+D exit on an empty prompt | Ctrl+O detail tier | Ctrl+L redraw
  Tab complete a command | Up/Down input history | scrolling stays native
